# Optional local Web Push configuration. Copy to .dev.vars and fill in your own values.
# Keep these unset to run without Internet push. Never commit .dev.vars.
# FARBFELD_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=your-own-public-key
# FARBFELD_VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=your-own-private-key
# FARBFELD_VAPID_SUBJECT=https://example.com/contact
